<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cookie Policy — Sassy's Cleaning</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#F1ECDB;
    --paper-2:#E7DFC4;
    --card:#FBF8EE;
    --ink:#211D15;
    --muted:#726A54;
    --rust:#B6432C;
    --moss:#57633F;
    --line:#211D15;
    --line-soft:rgba(33,29,21,0.16);
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgba(33,29,21,0.06) 1px, transparent 0);
    background-size:22px 22px;
  }
  h1,h2{
    font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  a{color:var(--rust);}
  .wrap{ max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }

  header{
    background:var(--paper);
    border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);
  }
  nav{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:14px 24px; max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .logo{ font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif; font-size:16px; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .back-link{ font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); }
  .back-link:hover{ color:var(--rust); }

  main{ padding:64px 0 80px; }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--paper);
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:18px;
    background:var(--moss); padding:5px 10px; border:1px solid var(--ink);
    transform:rotate(-1deg);
  }
  h1{ font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); margin-bottom:12px; }
  .updated{ font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:40px; }

  .policy-card{
    background:var(--card); border:2px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--moss);
    padding:36px;
  }
  .policy-card h2{ font-size:18px; margin:32px 0 12px; }
  .policy-card h2:first-child{ margin-top:0; }
  .policy-card p{ font-size:15px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .policy-card p.muted-text{ color:var(--muted); }
  .policy-card ul{ list-style:none; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .policy-card ul li{ font-size:15px; margin-bottom:8px; padding-left:20px; position:relative; }
  .policy-card ul li::before{ content:'—'; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--rust); }
  .policy-card table{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:8px 0 20px; font-size:14px; }
  .policy-card table th, .policy-card table td{ text-align:left; padding:10px 12px; border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line-soft); }
  .policy-card table th{ font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; color:var(--muted); }

  footer{ border-top:3px solid var(--ink); padding:28px 0; }
  .footer-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }
  .muted{ color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; }
  .footer-links a{ color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; margin-left:16px; }
  .footer-links a:hover{ color:var(--rust); }

  @media (max-width:600px){
    .policy-card{ padding:24px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">Sassy's Cleaning</div>
    <a href="index.html" class="back-link">← Back to site</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="policy-card">
      <h2>What this covers</h2>
      <p>This page explains what cookies and similar technologies are used on this site, and why.</p>

      <h2>What we use</h2>
      <p class="muted-text">This site does not use tracking or advertising cookies. The only storage used is:</p>
      <table>
        <tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        <tr><td>sassy-cookie-consent</td><td>Remembers your cookie preference</td><td>Until cleared</td></tr>
      </table>

      <h2>Booking form data</h2>
      <p>When you submit a booking request, the details you enter (name, console, contact info, notes) are sent to us to arrange your clean. This isn't a cookie — it's only sent when you actively submit the form.</p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Google Fonts — loads typefaces used on this site</li>
        <li>Your booking data may be stored via our booking system to manage requests</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can clear cookies at any time through your browser settings. Since this site avoids tracking cookies, clearing storage won't affect anything except needing to re-enter form details.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Reach out at <a href="mailto:sassydevicecleaning@gmail.com">sassydevicecleaning@gmail.com</a> with any questions about this policy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-row">
    <div class="logo" style="font-size:13px;">Sassy's Cleaning</div>
    <span class="muted">DM to book · Xbox &amp; PlayStation only</span>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="cookies.html">Cookie Policy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
